{
  "_id": "bhmBrandAxiom000",
  "name": "Brand of Axiom",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-star-pentagon-orange-purple.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mutagenic hemocraft lets your Brand of Castigation reveal a foe's true nature. Any Illusion or Invisibility effect active on a creature ends when you brand it, and the creature can't benefit from Illusion or Invisibility effects while branded by you.</p>\n<p>If a creature branded by you is in an alternate form (by means of the <em>Polymorph</em> spell, the Change Shape action, a Shapechanger trait, the Wild Shape feature, or a similar effect), it must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw against your Hemocraft save DC or revert to its true form and have the Stunned condition until the end of your next turn. Whenever a creature branded by you attempts to change its form, it must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw against your Hemocraft save DC or have the attempt fail and gain the Stunned condition until the end of your next turn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
